  "issue_body": "## Goal\nEvaluate router outputs on `SWE-bench Verified` by applying patches and running the benchmark harness.\n\n## Scope\n- Extract patch from model output\n- Create isolated workdir\n- Checkout target repo/commit\n- Apply patch safely\n- Run verification/tests\n- Return binary pass/fail result\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- patch tasks can be scored through a dedicated runner\n- failures are reported cleanly\n- evaluator does not contaminate other benchmark paths\n",
